      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GLENEAGLE RULER (10) came from this row to win here last month and has been competitive since. Made it three placings on the trot when 1.5 metres from the winner in second in the Cherry City Cup at Young last start. With even luck he can add to a good record here. SWEET NATE (2) had a very wide draw when resuming so his effort for fifth had merit. Fitter and much better drawn. Has decent records both here and at the distance so is capable of playing a major role. RIKIBREAL (1) hasn't been too far off the placings of late. Two-time winner at this longer distance and draws to advantage. HUNTER SHANNON (9) had been racing well before copping a wide barrier last start. Draws for a trail here so could bounce back.",
